Fold many eval runs into named, gated metrics

Usage: fastskill eval scorecard [OPTIONS] --root <root> --metrics <metrics>

Options:
      --root <root>              Directory searched recursively for run directories
      --skills-dir <skills-dir>  Override the skills directory path
      --global                   Use global skills directory (~/.config/fastskill/skills)
      --metrics <metrics>        TOML file declaring the metrics and their thresholds
      --format <format>          Output format: table, json
  -v, --verbose                  Enable verbose output
      --json                     Shorthand for --format json
      --no-fail                  Report the numbers without failing on a metric below its threshold
  -h, --help                     Print help
  -V, --version                  Print version

Syntax: eval scorecard --root <DIR> --metrics <FILE> [OPTIONS]

Examples:
  fastskill eval scorecard --root ./sweep --metrics ./evals/metrics.toml
